        <item>
            <title>0.18.14</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 08:54:19 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.18.14</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.18.14</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.18.14</h2>
<ul>
<li>**Key shot** — tap the menu key and press a direction key at once: the pill fires and its confirmation appears black under the pointer. A direction key on an open menu fires as before</li>
<li>**Settings, one card per way** — the ⌘ Command tab lists each way to open as its own card; the hand tab has &quot;Swipe shot&quot; and &quot;Key shot&quot;, each with a switch and its settings</li>
<li>**App keys, set where you see them** — in arrange on an app&#x27;s menu, a key cap under each layer number records the modifier that opens that layer in that app, with a clear badge; the old global switch is gone</li>
<li>**Library suggestions** — a suggestion row shows the pill&#x27;s name, then its kind and what it does</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
